<h2>Research Data and Computational Code</h2>

<h3>Multistrain Influenza First-Passage-Time Study</h3>

<p>
The computational materials associated with this study include the MATLAB
code used for model calibration, stochastic simulation, first-passage-time
analysis, sensitivity analysis, and figure generation, together with the
corresponding numerical output.
</p>

<p>
The repository also contains additional season- and strain-specific results
that are not included in the manuscript or Supplementary Material.
</p>

